        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>His Approach to Care</h2>
          <p>Dr. Phillips believes most dental decisions are bigger than a single tooth &mdash; they&rsquo;re about how you eat, speak, sleep, and feel about yourself. Every consultation begins with a real conversation: what brought you in, what you&rsquo;ve tried before, and what you actually want the outcome to look like. He believes deeply in second chances, and in making every patient feel genuinely welcome &mdash; no judgment about how long it&rsquo;s been, and never any pressure to commit on the spot.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>A Heart for Veterans</h2>
          <p>As a veteran himself, Dr. Phillips has a particular commitment to those who have worn the uniform. 3rd Set Smiles is proud to be a veteran-owned practice, and to offer special consideration for veterans without dental insurance. <a href="/veterans/">Learn more about our care for veterans →</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>Beyond the Office</h2>
          <p>Outside the practice, Dr. Phillips is a lifelong Arizonan and a proud Army veteran &mdash; happiest when he&rsquo;s given someone a reason to smile again.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in pull-quote">
          <p>&ldquo;I listen first, examine second, and only then talk about treatment. People deserve honest answers &mdash; not a sales pitch.&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS, Founder</cite>
        </div>

